{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loopstructor 2: Skyspine</strong> is a wasteland steampunk tower defense game. In the shattered world after The Sinking, you play as a Cohort Commander, tasked with eliminating ground-based abominations, reclaiming lost territory, and fighting for humanity's final aerial sanctuary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay: Loop-based Tower Defense</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build intricate rail networks, deploy and upgrade unique Battle Trains, and harness the new Turret Enchantment system to transform your mobile fortresses into devastating engines of defense. Every decision matters, and every move could mean survival\u2014or collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841840/extras/73532e694680a2932ec3603894d64567.poster.avif?t=1773045486\" width=600 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841840/extras/73532e694680a2932ec3603894d64567.webm?t=1773045486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841840/extras/73532e694680a2932ec3603894d64567.mp4?t=1773045486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deep Strategy</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dynamically shifting battlefield with endless tactical combinations tests your planning and adaptability. <strong>48 turret types</strong>, <strong>10+ enchantments</strong>, and <strong>multiple upgrade paths</strong>\u2014countless tactical builds await discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841840/extras/127c5215ccde1461bdeb5d43df7a59f1.poster.avif?t=1773045486\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841840/extras/127c5215ccde1461bdeb5d43df7a59f1.webm?t=1773045486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841840/extras/127c5215ccde1461bdeb5d43df7a59f1.mp4?t=1773045486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>High Replayability</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock diverse turrets, unique bases, and powerful relics to craft your own tactical playstyle. Each run offers a new experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Moral Choice</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you unveil the dark truth behind the floating city, when absolute sincerity collides with inescapable original sin\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Hold fast to your convictions, or raise the banner of rebellion?</u></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Add <strong>Loopstructor 2: Skyspine</strong> to your Steam Wishlist today! Prepare yourself for the mission ahead.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3841840?t=1773045486","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3841840?t=1773045486","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841840/c23586fec2f617d87525e4b34b48fcbc6d96ba80/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773045486","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841840/c23586fec2f617d87525e4b34b48fcbc6d96ba80/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773045486","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":